      "text": "decline in the real value added of support services -1.0\nto business, the sector of contract of previously -1.5\nsubcontracted workers, in 2022Q2–Q3. Based on -2.0\nemployment developments, one would have -2.5\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "S00004",
